    "title": "Stakeholders Relationship Committee Report 2024-25",
    "summary": "The page covers the Stakeholders Relationship Committee (SRC) of Max Healthcare Institute Limited for FY 2024-25. It details SRC composition (3 members, including 2 independent directors and CMD), meeting dates and 100% attendance, governance (compliance with SEBI regulations, Company Secretary as Secretary, senior management invitations, Board approval of decisions), and the Compliance Officer. It outlines terms of reference, key matters considered (grievance resolution, satisfaction survey review, voting rights, RTA service standards, unclaimed dividends), the second annual Shareholders Satisfaction Survey (sent to ~1.5 lakh shareholders, 6 questions, overall score: 15% excellent, 63% good, 22% needs improvement), and the Investor Grievance Redressal Policy emphasizing prompt service and investor satisfaction.",
}
